          "value_raw": "Up to three hazards (see the Environments section onpage 152), each of CR 3 or less, imperil creatures in the area, though never with more than one hazard at a time.If a creature places this curse, it can choose the hazards.The hazards must be appropriate to the type of terrain (atthe GM’s discretion). Any of the hazards that are rendered safe reset themselves and become dangerous again at each midnight.",
